WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.600
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:08.240
Stop trying to use The Power&nbsp;
of Love to kill SCP-682!

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:13.600
SCP-682 cannot be neutralized by the power of&nbsp;
love, the power of friendship, believing in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:18.800
yourself, or any other intangible power that might&nbsp;
save the day in an animated children's movie.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.920
It's a nice enough idea, but it's largely&nbsp;
ineffective, and until you can bring some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:28.240
hard data to the table supporting&nbsp;
the firepower that Love might have,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.200
we'll settle for the Power of Acid instead.

